r opponents control this turn.", 'You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of creatures you control.', 'You may reveal a multicolored card you own from outside the game and put it into your hand. Exile Glittering Wish.', '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 colorless Sliver artifact creature token named Metallic Sliver.', '{1}{B}: Regenerate Augur of Skulls.\nSacrifice Augur of Skulls: Target player discards two cards. Activate only during your upkeep.', '{1}{R}, Remove a time counter from a permanent you control or suspended card you own: Rift Elemental gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "{2}, Exile a nonland card from your hand: Put four time counters on the exiled card. If it doesn't have suspend, it gains suspend. (At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from that card. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. If it's a creature, it has haste.)", '{2}: Sarcomite Myr gains flying until end of turn.\n{2}, Sacrifice Sarcomite Myr: Draw a card.', '{2}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature that was dealt damage this turn.', '{6}, {T}: Return target Rebel permanent card with mana value 5 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 black Zombie Goblin creature token named Festering Goblin. It has "When Festering Goblin dies, target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn."', '{G}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 green Elf Druid creature token named Llanowar Elves. It has "{T}: Add {G}."', "{R}, Return Grinning Ignus to its owner's hand: Add {C}{C}{R}. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 3/1 red Elemental creature token named Spark Elemental. It has trample, haste, and "At the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Spark Elemental."', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {W}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Horizon Canopy: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{T}: Put a charge counter on Coalition Relic.\nAt the beginning of your precombat main 